  "x = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">priama: y = 3 · {@1} = {@2}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">nepriama: y = 36 : {@3} = {@4}</span>": "x = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">diretta: y = 3 · {@1} = {@2}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">inversa: y = 36 : {@3} = {@4}</span>",
