  "<span class=\"c-accent\">aritmetická: a₈ = {@0}, s₈ = {@1}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">geometrická: a₈ = {@2}, s₈ = {@3}</span>": "<span class=\"c-accent\">aritmetica: a₈ = {@0}, s₈ = {@1}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">geometrica: a₈ = {@2}, s₈ = {@3}</span>",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">u = ({@0}; {@1})</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">n = ({@2}; {@3})</span><br>p: x = {@4}, y = {@5}, t ∈ R<br>všeobecná rovnica: {@6} = 0 · {@7}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">u = ({@0}; {@1})</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">n = ({@2}; {@3})</span><br>p: x = {@4}, y = {@5}, t ∈ R<br>equazione generale: {@6} = 0 · {@7}",
  "A trikrát, N dvakrát, S raz": "A tre volte, N due volte, S una volta",
