  "teda $\\alpha=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}={@2}$ a $\\beta=\\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}={@5}$.": "quindi $\\alpha=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}={@2}$ e $\\beta=\\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}={@5}$.",
